The long-running portion is the required structure-aware 200,000-candidate measurement, not instance construction. Each sampled answer already satisfies the declared coefficient, distinctness, shape, and fully-mixed constraints; the verifier is checking an exact finite-field rejection screen followed by rational polynomial identities when needed. No result has been assumed from cardinality alone.
