    73	| easy | 970415566 | Gemini 3.8 Flash | error; OpenRouter total key limit exceeded |
    74	| easy | 44819310 | GPT-5.6 Terra | error; OpenRouter total key limit exceeded |
    75	| easy | 2055990601 | Gemini 3.8 Flash | error; OpenRouter total key limit exceeded |
